ING CHI NEI TSANG TO COMMON AILMENTS   286","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"CH 11:  WORKING PROCEDURES","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"CH 12:  CHI NEI TSANG AND STRESS MANAGEMENT     346","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"CH 13:  CHI NEI TSANG AND CLINICAL PSYCHOLOGY    356","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"CH 14:  INTERVIEWS AND CASE HISTORIES     368","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"BIBLIOGRAPHY AND RECOMMENDED BOOKS    393","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"ABOUT THE AUTHOR           395","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"THE UNIVERSAL TAO SYSTEM AND TRAINING CENTER   396","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"INDEX         398","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}}],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"THE TECHNIQUES OF CHI NEI TSANG EVOLVED IN ASIA DURING AN ERA WHEN FEW PHYSICIANS WERE AVAILABLE AND PEOPLE HAD TO KNOW HOW TO HEAL THEMSELVES.  MANY PEOPLE TODAY HAVE SYMPTOMS THAT MODERN MEDICINE IS NOT ABLE TO CURE BECAUSE A PHYSICAL SOURCE FOR THE PROBLEM IS NOT EASILY FOUND.  THE ENERGIES OF NEGATIVE EMOTIONS, STRESS, AND TENSION--ALL COMMON IN MODERN LIFE--AND THE WEIGHT OF PAST ILLNESSES ACCUMULATE IN THE ABDOMINAL CENTER, CAUSING ENERGY BLOCKAGES AND CONGESTION.  WHEN THIS OCCURS, ALL VITAL FUNCTIONS STAGNATE AND MYRIAD PROBLEMS ARISE.  BY PRACTICING THE TECHNIQUES OF CHI NEI TSANG, THIS STAGNATION IS REMOVED AND THE VITAL ORGANS SURROUNDING THE NAVEL CENTER ARE DETOXIFIED AND REJUVENATED.\r\n\r\nMASTER CHIA TEACHES READERS HOW TO TAKE FULL CHARGE OF THEIR HEALTH USING THE SELF-HEALING TECHNIQUES OF CHI NEI TSANG.  HE OFFERS FULLY ILLUSTRATED EXERCISES THAT SHOW HOW TO DETOXIFY THE INTERNAL ORGANS AND CLEAR THE ENERGY (CHI) CHANNELS THROUGHOUT THE BODY.  HE ALSO PRESENTS METHODS FOR BALANCING EMOTIONS, MANAGING STRESS, AND OBSERVING THE BODY IN ORDER TO RECOGNIZE, AMELIORATE, AND PREVENT MALADIES BEFORE THEY BECOME A PROBLEM."},"weight":"1.2 pounds","isbn_10":["1594771057"],"covers":[873133],"physical_format":"Paperback","lc_classifications":["RM727.C54M36 2007","RM727.C54 M36 2007"],"key":"/books/OL8879060M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL430134A","name":"Mantak Chia"}],"subtitle":"CHI MASSAGE FOR THE VITAL ORGANS","publish_places":["ROCHESTER, VT"],"isbn_13":["9781594771057"],"pagination":"i - x; 405 p.","classifications":{},"source_records":["bwb:9781594771057","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part33.utf8:127253850:2140"],"title":"CHI NEI TSANG","number_of_pages":405,"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Oriental martial arts","Martial Arts","Body, Mind & Spirit","Consumer Health","New Age","Healing - Energy (Chi Kung, Reiki, Polarity)","Massage & Reflexotherapy","Taoist","Body, Mind & Spirit / Healing / Energy (Chi Kung, Reiki, Polarity)","Eastern - Taoism","Martial Arts & Self-Defense","Massage","Medicine, Oriental Traditional","Qi gong","methods"],"publish_date":"1993, January 6, 2007","oclc_numbers":["71233146"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL2856671W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"physical_dimensions":"9.0 x 6.0 x 1.0 inches","lccn":["2006028684"],"latest_revision":12,"revision":12,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-30T09:38:13.731961"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-12-14T04:56:16.548534"}}},"ISBN:9780935621358":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780935621358","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL1898710M/Chi_Nei_Tsang","preview":"restricted","preview_url":"https://archive.org/details/chineitsanginter0000chia","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/4803001-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Healing Tao Books"],"identifiers":{"goodreads":["551144"],"librarything":["1585432"]},"subtitle":"internal or